<title>CHINA: Agricultural Bank of China to set US$120 mln FRN.</title>
<headline>Agricultural Bank of China to set US$120 mln FRN.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-07-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following floating rate certificates of deposit issue will be launched bond-style in early August, the joint bookrunners said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>BORROWER  AGRICULTURAL BANK OF CHINA, SINGAPORE BRANCH</p>
<p> AMOUNT    US$120 MLN  COUPON	6ML+30BP  MATURITY   5 YRS</p>
<p> TYPE	FRCD	  ISS PRICE   PAR	 RE-OFFER   99.875</p>
<p> PUTS	NONE	  CALLS	 NONE	LAUNCH    EARLY AUG</p>
<p> LISTING   --	    REPAYMENT   BULLET    REPLIES   EARLY AUG</p>
<p> RATING    --	    SALES LMTS  STANDARD  DENOMS    US$250K</p>
<p> GOV LAW   --	    HOME CTRY   CHINA     PAY DATE  LATE AUG</p>
<p>MGT FEES AND LEVELS</p>
<p>   CO-ARRANGERS	 US$5 MLN  15BP  ALL-IN  33BP</p>
<p>   CO-LEAD MANAGERS   US$3 MLN  15BP  ALL-IN  33BP</p>
<p>ARRANGERS AND JOINT BOOKRUNNERS</p>
<p>BAYERISCHE LANDESBANK'S HONGKONG BRANCH AND SOCIETE GENERALE</p>
<p>ASIA</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong newsroom (852) 2843 6960</p>
</text>
